e","source_order":[14,295,0],"order":3096}],"persons":[{"id":"chengguo-p0048","name":"陈策","evidence":["chengguo-q-f41100bec50a165839a8","chengguo-q-c371dcb2900a08e74d25","chengguo-q-0dea9d4a54d6a61ad56e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-0dea9d4a54d6a61ad56e","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-5fef362ac78411e6ca80","layer":"original","quote":"太祖笑曰：“卿言近之！”遂遣猛将在前，大军在后。至则克策，如晔所度。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-c371dcb2900a08e74d25","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-9b510a8a214a6725f410","layer":"original","quote":"策等小竖〖3〗，因乱赴险，遂相依为强耳；非有爵命威信相伏也。往者偏将资轻，而中国未夷〖4〗，故策敢据险以守；今天下略定，后伏先诛〖5〗。夫畏死趋赏，愚智所同。故广武君为韩信画策〖6〗，谓其威名足以先声后实而服邻国也〖7〗。岂况明公之德，东征西怨〖8〗？先开赏募，大兵临之；令宣之日，军门启而虏自溃矣","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":4,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-f41100bec50a165839a8","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-2531dce597be54de6410","layer":"original","quote":"太祖至寿春。时庐江界有山贼陈策〖1〗，众数万人，临险而守。先时遣偏将致诛〖2〗，莫能擒克。太祖问群下：“可伐与不？”咸云：“山峻高而溪谷深隘，守易攻难；又无之不足为损，得之不足为益","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
